id=euicc_universal
name=eSIM Management (Universal, patched LPA)
version=1.1
versionCode=2
author=local
description=Same as Universal v1.0 (euicc feature + OpenEUICC privileged LPA) but with the PATCHED OpenEUICC APK (shouldIgnoreSlot=false). REQUIRED on devices whose modem natively reports the removable eUICC (EID present in IccCardStatus, e.g. Xiaomi HyperOS): the stock LPA ignores such slots and Settings never marks the subscription isEmbedded, so it appears as a physical SIM. Verified on Xiaomi Redmi K40 Pro (mars), HyperOS 2.0.7.0 Android 16. Requires Android 12+, Magisk/KernelSU with system_ext mount support, CorePatch (or disabled signature verification).
